<title>USA: TABLE - Ocwen Financial Corp Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Ocwen Financial Corp Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>WEST PALM BEACH, Fla. 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second Quarter   Six Months</p>
<p>In thousands of dollars,</p>
<p>  except per share data   1997	1996	1997	1996</p>
<p> Revenues		   $62,664   $33,744  $115,751   $56,860</p>
<p>Provision for loan losses</p>
<p>				(7,909)   (4,964)  (17,651)  (14,370)</p>
<p> Operating expenses    (30,837)  (13,870)  (53,534)  (25,554)</p>
<p> Income tax expense     (5,126)   (2,911)   (8,733)   (1,910)</p>
<p> Net income		  18,792    11,999    35,833    15,026</p>
<p> Net income per share	0.69	0.45	1.32	0.57</p>
<p>*  1997 Q2 includes $23.4 million of gains on sales of interest earning assets in the second quarter of 1997 which is primarily comprised of a $16.8 million net gain earned in connection with the securitization of single-family residential discount mortgage loans and a $4.5 million gain in connection with securitization of single-family loans to non-conforming borrowers.</p>
<p>At June 30, 1997 the Company had $2.79 billion of total assets as compared to $2.48 billion at December 31, 1996.</p>
</text>
